sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	participant Catalog as Catalog API
	participant PostgreSQL as PostgreSQL
	participant Scheduler as Scheduler
	participant Broker as Kafka Broker
	participant Ingestion as Catalog Ingestion
	participant Foundry as Microsoft Foundry
	participant Qdrant as Qdrant

	Catalog ->> PostgreSQL: Synchronous catalog change
	PostgreSQL ->> PostgreSQL: Record pending revision
	Scheduler -->> Broker: Scheduled batch trigger
	Broker -->> Ingestion: Asynchronous batch request
	Ingestion ->> PostgreSQL: Acquire exclusive batch access

	alt Lock held or queue empty
		PostgreSQL -->> Ingestion: Exit without work
	else Lock acquired
		Ingestion ->> PostgreSQL: Read at most 200 revisions

		loop Active revisions
			Ingestion ->> Foundry: Synchronous embedding request
			Foundry -->> Ingestion: Embedding vector
		end
		Ingestion ->> Qdrant: Upsert active vectors
		Ingestion ->> Qdrant: Delete vectors for removed books

		alt Processing succeeds
			Ingestion ->> PostgreSQL: Acknowledge only matching revisions
		else Embedding or index fails
			Ingestion -->> PostgreSQL: Leave revisions pending
		end
		Ingestion ->> PostgreSQL: Release exclusive access
	end
